    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό-γνωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>foreknowledge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ju.</u>
				9.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>perceiving beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.399d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				982c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
