			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Medic.,
				<i>prognosis</i> of diseases, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῳακαὶ
				π.</span> title of work by <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
