				Agath.
			</span></i>); title of work by Democritus. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>prediction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				17.13
			</span></i>, al.</div>
